// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P2496206502" "The codes you got from the Sky Raiders still work. But is it too late?"
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P1377274248" "An intruder? Just as Arbiter Sands predicted."
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P2824033608" "Hah! You're too late, {HeroName}! <em>For the glory of Arachnos!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Vault 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ModelDisplayName :
"P1412394251" "Secure Vault"
// Description :
"P1238533194" "Find the PCM!"
// InteractBeginString :
"P1257149305" "You begin opening the crate"
// InteractCompleteString :
"P4206309487" "You have opened the crate"
// InteractActionString :
"P1143515829" "Opening..."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1398429640" "The vault is empty, save for a note."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P987693955" "You were too late. Arbiter Sands has outmaneuvered everyone."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2955148161" "Well... <br><br>I know this looks bad, but it's not over yet. I've been in communication with two other agents, code-named Indigo and Crimson. They believe that Sands has not yet left Paragon City. There may still be time to stop him before he can deliver the PCM to his masters."
// RandomFameString :
"P3117559771" "{HeroName}? I could swear that was the name of a villain..."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission4 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3345437461" "I have a plan. Arbiter Sands is still in Faultline, probably trying to avoid detection until he can escape to the Rogue Isles. The PsychoChronoMetron requires psychic powers to activate and Arbiter Sands has none. However, he does have a rival who has access to psychic powers, is antagonistic to Sands, and may know how and when he plans to escape Paragon City: Nocturne, the Night Widow. The plan is to lure Nocturne into a trap and get the information from her."
// AcceptString :
"P2425906855" "Draw out Nocturne"
// SendOffString :
"P961509183" "We know that Arbiter Sands and the Night Widow, Nocturne, are enemies. From what we know of the internal structure of Arachnos, this isn't an uncommon situation and we can turn it to our advantage. I will plant false information that Longbow has potential blackmail material against Sands hidden in our base in the dam. If she takes the bait, we catch her and find out about Arbiter Sands' most likely escape routes and times. Your job is to catch her in the dam. It's a long shot, but it's all we have. <br><br><color orange>I'd recommend that you get any allies with you into the computer room before springing the trap. Being separated would be very bad when Arachnos arrives.</color>"
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2071063575" "Ambush Nocturne"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P94542427" "If we don't catch Nocturne now, we may never get a shot at Sands."
// TaskSubTitle :
"P2753106874" "<color deepskyblue>Part Four</color>"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P2899207688" "It's all quiet now, but once the trap is sprung, the fireworks will begin."
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P1487586253" "Operative Jenkins"
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P3800737684" "C'mon, guys!"
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P891819458" "Alright, chumps, let's do this!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// CutScene 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// 12 B_Boss :
"P3328746823" "<f=Camera><em=plotting>Now, my minions, search this place! <em=shakefist>With Longbow's files on Arbiter Sands I will be able to break him! <em=evilLaugh>And claim the PsychoChronoMetron for my own!"
// 4 M_Talk :
"P2377161405" "<f=B_Boss><em=Salute>Ma'am! There's nothing here, but Jenkins said he saw {HeroName}!"
// 4 B_Boss :
"P2071267607" "<em=CurseYou>{HeroName}! It's a trap! <em=SlashThroat>Kill {HeroName}, then we must escape!"
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P1590788888" "Night Widow Nocturne"
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P685709564" "I will tolerate your life no longer."
// Script Variable BOSS_1STBLOOD_DIALOG :
"P1355457303" "Are you hurting? Excellent."
// Script Variable BOSS_75HEALTH_DIALOG :
"P2251286011" "If this is your best, I hardly need to worry."
// Script Variable BOSS_50HEALTH_DIALOG :
"P2558163935" "I won't let you live."
// Script Variable BOSS_25HEALTH_DIALOG :
"P3084565384" "You insolent whelp!"
// Script Variable BOSS_DEAD_DIALOG :
"P3010787378" "I can't lose now..."
// Script Variable BOSS_KILLEDHERO_DIALOG :
"P2988814276" "Your death was a certainty the moment you opposed me."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - NocturnedOut 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Description :
"P3354851518" "Defeat Night Widow Nocturne"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P619960455" "You have defeated Nocturne the Night Widow!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Computer 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ModelDisplayName :
"P970024286" "Press button to set Trap"
// Description :
"P1834106870" "Activate Trap"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P180513999" "The trap is set!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2383653323" "You sprung the trap and defeated Nocturne the Night Widow!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P4203946260" "You've done excellent work today, {HeroName}. Nocturne is on her way to Ziggursky, but I learned what we needed to know from her. I told her that Sands sold her out to us to keep her from messing with his plans. She was more than willing to talk to get back at him. She was able to tell us how and when Sands plans to escape, but she also told us that she gave that information to someone else in an attempt to delay Sands: Captain Castillo of the Sky Raiders."
// RandomFameString :
"P4082510063" "I heard {HeroName} caught an Arachnos assassin in Faultline!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission5 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3876414863" "We now know how, when, and where Sands is planning to escape with the PCM, but Nocturne also told Captain Castillo. I don't think Castillo really knows what the PsychoChronoMetron actually does, just that it's valuable. He's certain to try and get it. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I think the best option is a pre-emptive strike to stop him.</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P545844173" "Defeat Captain Castillo"
// SendOffString :
"P3722676997" "Taking out Castillo may destabilize the area and allow Arachnos to get entrenched, but we don't have any choice. If the Sky Raiders even have a chance at getting the PCM, it could show up anywhere on the black market. Defeating Castillo now will not only keep him from interfering with the recovery operation. It should also keep the Sky Raiders off our backs until the situation is resolved."
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2969853535" "Capture Captain Castillo. Then we can start the final phase."
// TaskSubTitle :
"P397691594" "<color deepskyblue>Part Five</color>"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P4233642125" "The Sky Raider supply warehouse is remarkably well kept. They're pretty organized, at least."
// Script Variable ACTOR_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P4061119062" "So, what's this next raid all about?"
// Script Variable ACTOR2_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P3220242221" "It's all for some widget. <em>The Psycho-Something or other. The Captain knows the details."
// Script Variable ACTOR_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P1485401236" "It's {HeroName}!"
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P1576366095" "Captain Castillo"
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P2748234963" "This is to be my moment of greatest triumph!"
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P3025249604" "What are you doing here, {HeroName}?"
// Script Variable BOSS_1STBLOOD_DIALOG :
"P70767911" "The battle, as you will soon discover, shall be mine!"
// Script Variable BOSS_75HEALTH_DIALOG :
"P1835401540" "Ah! You appear to have done harm to my well-tailored uniform!"
// Script Variable BOSS_50HEALTH_DIALOG :
"P3552784168" "You have done harm to my person, and that is a harm of the sort I cannot abide!"
// Script Variable BOSS_25HEALTH_DIALOG :
"P1635434966" "Truly, you fight with the will of one who is almost the equal of myself!"
// Script Variable BOSS_DEAD_DIALOG :
"P56344731" "This is a happening that is impossible..."
// Script Variable BOSS_KILLEDHERO_DIALOG :
"P3609022312" "If you are unable to bow at my skill as you fall over, that is alright."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - CatchingCastillo 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2392176068" "You have defeated Captain Castillo!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - CastilloDesk 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ModelDisplayName :
"P2624859454" "Capt. Castillo's Desk"
// Description :
"P2372740544" "Find Castillo's Info"
// InteractBeginString :
"P181887808" "You begin searching through the desk"
// InteractCompleteString :
"P4063949666" "You finished searching through the desk"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1709716038" "You found some information"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P4255809075" "You have defeated Captain Castillo and found some vital information."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3987329742" "Castillo is in custody and the information you retrieved confirms what Nocturne told us. It would be better if we could get a third source, but Arachnos has changed their codes and there's no time. Arbiter Sands is leaving soon. You've got to stop him."
// RandomFameString :
"P4142808189" "I heard {HeroName} gave the Sky Raiders a major setback in Faultline!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission6 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3038421447" "The information Castillo had matches what Nocturne had told us. Arachnos has been bringing men and materials into the city through a series of underground rivers that lead to the ocean using submersibles. Arbiter Sands will attempt to leave the city the same way, but we know where and when. This is our last chance to keep Arachnos from getting the PsychoChronoMetron. It's a lot to ask of anyone. Can I count on you?"
// AcceptString :
"P623664267" "Stop Arbiter Sands and get the PCM"
// SendOffString :
"P3136298485" "Good. The underground channels depend on the tides so we have some guarantee for the departure times. This place will be heavily defended. You will need to cut off Arbiter Sands' means of escape by destroying any and all submersibles docked at the base, and then capture Arbiter Sands himself. Sands will have the PsychoChronoMetron on his person."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P489005495" "Recover the PsychoChronoMetron"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2143948176" "Good luck. The fate of the world may be on your shoulders."
// TaskSubTitle :
"P1466364941" "<color deepskyblue>Part Six</color>"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P105083921" "Deep in the earth, the sinister presence of Arachnos hides from the eyes of justice, but not from you!"
// Script Variable ACTOR_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P639526971" "Don't know. <em>Arbiter's orders, that's all I know."
// Script Variable ACTOR2_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P2731537430" "Security is really tight. Are the Sky Raiders going to attack?"
// Script Variable ACTOR_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P1777711222" "That's no Sky Raider! That's {HeroName}!"
// Script Variable PATROLLER1_SEARCHING_DIALOG :
"P3888962452" "We'll continue our sweep."
// Script Variable PATROLLER2_SEARCHING_DIALOG :
"P485363497" "I hate the echoes in here."
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P3187534667" "Arbiter Sands"
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P1742659623" "The tides are right. It's time to deliver Lord Recluse his final victory."
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P1208987132" "Now this is absolutely bothersome."
// Script Variable BOSS_1STBLOOD_DIALOG :
"P3597289358" "It is {HeroName}, right? You've been tenacious. I despise that in a Hero."
// Script Variable BOSS_75HEALTH_DIALOG :
"P1676421172" "You've harmed me. Again. This won't do."
// Script Variable BOSS_50HEALTH_DIALOG :
"P894778474" "You are beginning to vex me. <em>I say that to very few people. <em>Most of them are dead now."
// Script Variable BOSS_25HEALTH_DIALOG :
"P3421262896" "Normally, I'd teleport to safety now, but that is, sadly, not possible at the moment."
// Script Variable BOSS_DEAD_DIALOG :
"P247747811" "Well. This is an unfortunate turn of events."
// Script Variable BOSS_KILLEDHERO_DIALOG :
"P4051276905" "I am going to request that the PCM is used on you. You'd be a useful henchman."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - SandsStorm 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Description :
"P2689358226" "Capture Arbiter Sands!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1836775884" "You defeated Arbiter Sands and recovered the PsychoChronoMetron!"
// Script Variable OBJECT_DISPLAYNAME :
"P2524914541" "Arachnos mini-sub"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - LikeTheHunley 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Description :
"P3417628519" "subs to destroy"
// SingularDescription :
"P3499929930" "1 sub to destroy"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1365212412" "You have destroyed an Arachnos mini-sub!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3477133909" "You destroyed the sub base and recovered the PsychoChronoMetron!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1706901913" "So, this is it? Incredible. We both know what it can do. It has to be destroyed, and in a manner that prevents it from ever being built again. That means using the PsychoChronoMetron against itself to edit its own history, and maybe even some of the laws of reality. Turning Faultline into a villain is trivial compared to this. To overcome the backlash, you'd need someone with more psychic power than Sister Psyche. Someone with psychic power on the order of the Clockwork King... <br><br>Or Penelope Yin."
// RandomFameString :
"P2545856654" "I heard that {HeroName} took a super-weapon away from Arachnos!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission7 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1599831395" "The PsychoChronoMetron must be destroyed. Permanently. The only way to do it is by having an immensely powerful psychic use the PCM on itself, so that it can't work again. To do that, you'll need to contact one of the most powerful, albeit untrained, psychics on Earth: Penelope Yin. However, this will not be easy for 3 reasons: Arbiter Sands, Nocturne the Night Widow, and Captain Castillo all escaped custody during their transfer to Ziggursky Penitentiary. I fear they're going to try and intercept you.<A HREF={ACCEPT}>Tell me when you're ready, and I'll have a chopper waiting to take you to Yin's Market to meet with Penelope</A>. <color orange>Be careful. You might want to get more help, if you haven't already.</color>"
// AcceptString :
"P1854032899" "Destroy the PsychoChronoMetron!"
// SendOffString :
"P3363131411" "Secure Penelope Yin, give her the PCM, and tell her to order it never to work again. She should be able to take care of the rest. If you encounter Arbiter Sands, Nocturne the Night Widow, or Captain Castillo, don't concern yourself with them. In fact, you may be able to get them to eliminate each other, considering their history. <color orange>Getting the PCM to Penelope is your only objective.</color> If you stay on-track, it may only take you minutes. Good Luck."
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2117674481" "You've got to hurry. This thing cannot be allowed to exist!"
// TaskSubTitle :
"P3701972778" "<color deepskyblue>Part Finale</color>"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P759608621" "They're all here and they've got Penelope! But they don't look happy to see each other..."
// Script Variable BOSS_ONE_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P701737792" "You just don't know when to quit, do you? <em>I see... <em>Is this about the time I dumped you? <em>What do you want, Castillo? <em>... <em>I don't think so."
// Script Variable BOSS_ONE_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P3123820823" "For Lord Recluse, etc. etc."
// Script Variable BOSS_TWO_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P1185338540" "I'll never give up! <em>I'll use that device to change history, and I shall be the Ghost Widow! <em>Emotionless! Untouchable! <em>WHAT! <em>... <em>I think not!"
// Script Variable BOSS_TWO_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P1720505726" "Get out of my way if you don't want to die!"
// Script Variable BOSS_THREE_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P3343451307" "I hate to interrupt, but... <em>Excuse me! <em>Hello! Me! <em>Ahem! <em>I am hating to be the one doing the interrupting, <em>but I believe that I shall be making that valuable little widget belong to me."
// Script Variable BOSS_THREE_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P215467798" "Attack now, my Sky Raiders!"

