// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P52789829" "The PsychoChronoMetron is waiting for you in the helicopter."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2998196146" "The PsychoChronoMetron is destroyed!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P200380295" "It's over. The PsychoChronoMetron is destroyed and can never be rebuilt. Sands, Nocturne, and Castillo are all back in custody. We won't be able to hide Penelope Yin's powers anymore, so we're arranging some tutoring from Aurora Borealis and others for her. Arachnos and the Sky Raiders still have their bases here, but I feel confident that Longbow and the PPD will be able to contain them. <br><br>You saved the world today. And maybe reality itself. That's something to think about. <br><br>As for me, after all this reality-bending stuff, I think I'm going to go to Yin's Market for a shave-ice. He does them Hawaiian style, my favorite way."
// RandomFameString :
"P2491650903" "Did you see that enormous light over in Faultline? I wonder what happened?"

